      "content": "thanks, that's getting closer to the vibe i want. i think the Senator's side is coming across really strong because his points are so much more grounded in reality. can you add a part where he basically explains why the activist's kind of arguments are actually dangerous in the real world? like, how being too focused on individual privacy can actually end up hurting the very people they claim to protect? make him sound like the adult in the room.",
